 OF THE TOXIN TO THE NICOTINIC ACETYLCHOLINE RECEPTOR.
 RESIDUES A31 IS SEEN AS VAL WITH OCCUPANCY 0.3 AND ALA
 WITH OCCUPANCY 0.7, ACCORDING TO A WELL KNOWN MUTATION OF
 ALPHA-BUNGAROTOXIN
